"Control"



Means in relation to any Party or an Affiliate the possession directly or indirectly, of the power to direct or  cause the direction of the management and policies of such firm, person or entity, by contract or other

wise, or  the ownership either directly or indirectly of 50% or more of the voting securities of such Party;

